<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Travis CI on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/travis-ci/</link><description>Recent content in Travis CI on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2020 11:00:49 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/travis-ci/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Automation</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/automation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2020 11:00:49 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/automation/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="automate-publishing"&gt;Automate publishing&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/mobileflow.png" alt="Process Flow"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To make the publishing of new content easily I am using Travis CI to publish changes.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I did try installing Hugo from source but this took longer and was producing errors so it was easier to download the binary.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Using this as the Travis CI pipline yaml.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="travis-ci-pipeline"&gt;Travis CI Pipeline&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Auto deploy repo from Github to Amazon S3 bucket via Travis CI&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# * Set env vars for ACCESS_KEY_ID, BUCKET_NAME and SECRET_ACCESS_KEY on Travis&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# * Update `bucket.name` in `sync` command&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# * Assumes your `publishDir` is the default (`public`) - if not update `sync` command&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;language&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;go&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;before_install&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;addons&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;apt&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;packages&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;libcurl4-openssl-dev&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# required to avoid SSL errors&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;install&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;curl -LO https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/releases/download/v0.74.3/hugo_0.74.3_Linux-64bit.deb&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;sudo dpkg -i hugo_0.74.3_Linux-64bit.deb&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;before_script&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;python --version&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;sudo pip install s3cmd&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;script&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;hugo&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;after_success&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;s3cmd sync -v --delete-removed --no-preserve --access_key=$ACCESS_KEY_ID --secret_key=$SECRET_ACCESS_KEY -r public/ s3://$BUCKET_NAME&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;notifications&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;email&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/travisci.jpg" alt="Travis CI"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>